          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Twenty years into her rule, Asheviere turned her attention to the wood elves living in the great forest southwest of Wesnoth, whom she despised. Orcish mercenaries were hired and dispatched to bring about their ruin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Master Delfador! Look, there are orcs coming from all directions! What shall we do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("There are too many to fight, far too many. We must escape!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-elvish-concerned.webp",
            text: _("But to where? This is the only home we have! What about the elves?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("We will fight them, but you must escape, Konrad. It is imperative that you escape!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We will go north. Perhaps we can reach the Isle of Alduin. If we can make it there, surely we will be safe. Konrad, we must recruit some elves to help us, and then you must make it to the sign post in the northwest. I will protect you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Very well, let us hurry!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urug-Telfar",
            text: _("Attack the elves, my grunts, and take their villages. Let us claim this land for the Queen!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Knafa-Tan",
            text: _("Ha ha! We will rip the filthy elves to pieces!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("Let them come. We will fight them with all we have!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Be careful, Konrad! Guard him well, Delfador!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Do not spend your life here, Chantal. Someone must warn the Northern Elves that the war we so long feared has begun."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 0,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
